# ActivityPub edge rules

## Separate surface
- ActivityPub endpoints belong ONLY in `apps/federation-edge`.

## Store-first, process async
- Incoming inbox requests:
  1) verify request as needed (signatures/headers)
  2) persist the raw activity + metadata
  3) enqueue a job to process it
- Outgoing activities:
  1) persist activity/outbox record
  2) enqueue delivery jobs (per destination/host)

## Never block user requests on federation delivery
- Remote delivery is async only (retries/backoff handled by worker).

## Idempotency & dedupe
- Inbox processing must be idempotent.
- Delivery worker must dedupe attempts per (activity, destination).
